{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103480","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103480","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1710348001:1":{"text":"放肆！仪式还没有结束，是哪个家伙搞的名堂？","source_cn":"放肆！仪式还没有结束，是哪个家伙搞的名堂？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE90EBE1E4F861649","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710348002:1":{"text":"外面的守备军在做什么？怎么会无法走出圣古堂？","source_cn":"外面的守备军在做什么？怎么会无法走出圣古堂？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08A0CCC78C5A5026","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710348003:1":{"text":"回应她的，只有空旷大殿内的回声。外面死一般的寂静。","source_cn":"回应她的，只有空旷大殿内的回声。外面死一般的寂静。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4D94FD6B39D7D13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710348004:1":{"text":"竟然会有人无视本公主的命令……奇怪。","source_cn":"竟然会有人无视本公主的命令……奇怪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9279ACEC11B7C9FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710348005:1":{"text":"升华庆典的喧闹声也不见了……殿下，情况不对。这种寂静太反常了。","source_cn":"升华庆典的喧闹声也不见了……殿下，情况不对。这种寂静太...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7859312E69D1E4AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","docume